{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This<strong>\u00a0</strong>is an early prototype created by first-time student developers as part of an academic game design project. It is best understood as a demo rather than a fully polished  game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The experience takes place on a fictional college campus and explores uncomfortable, real-world scenarios related to identity, including race, gender, sexuality, and ableism. Through short interactive stories, players respond to challenging moments using different approaches (supportive, diplomatic, confrontational, or disengaged) and see how those choices shape conversations and relationships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This version  reflects students learning game design, narrative systems, and interactive storytelling for the first time. As such, it is rough around the edges, limited in scope, and experimental by design. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re interested in student work, experimental design, or seeing how a larger idea begins, this demo offers a candid look at the early foundations of the <i>Answer Campus</i> universe.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"7bb88d3de98ba9a6661b7e1060a405f055a05836.jpg","localized_name":"Mission Complete","name":"Mission Complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1165790/7bb88d3de98ba9a6661b7e1060a405f055a05836.jpg"}],"total":1},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1165790?t=1769567367","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1165790?t=1769567367","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1165790/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769567367","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1165790/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769567367","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The characters in the story use the same language as young adults today, which includes cursing."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This<strong>\u00a0</strong>is an early prototype created by first-time student developers as part of an academic game design project. It is best understood as a demo rather than a fully polished  game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The experience takes place on a fictional college campus and explores uncomfortable, real-world scenarios related to identity, including race, gender, sexuality, and ableism. Through short interactive stories, players respond to challenging moments using different approaches (supportive, diplomatic, confrontational, or disengaged) and see how those choices shape conversations and relationships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This version  reflects students learning game design, narrative systems, and interactive storytelling for the first time. As such, it is rough around the edges, limited in scope, and experimental by design. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re interested in student work, experimental design, or seeing how a larger idea begins, this demo offers a candid look at the early foundations of the <i>Answer Campus</i> universe.</p>","developers":["Clay Ewing","Lorena Lopez","Fabrizio Darby","Emilie Duran","Catherine Woods","Lesharyn Jackson","Gwyneth Johnson","Luz Cruz","Phidela Cheng","Cassandra Swilley","Yoland Victor","Nia James","Day Watson","Caleb Solomon","Asha Wills","Arianna Nicolas"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1165790/header.jpg?t=1769567367","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10.13<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 800 MB available sp